                             ! torque at kingpin
MZ_PARKING_STEER_OFFSET(1,1) 0 ; N-m ! [D] Added (after gain) to get steering torque
                               ! at kingpin
VX_START_MZ_PARKING_STEER(1,1) 0 ; km/h ! [D] Subtracted from vehicle speed
VX_SCALE_MZ_PARKING_STEER(1,1) 1 ! [D] Divided into (vehicle speed -
                                 ! VX_START_MZ_PARKING_STEER)
MZ_PARKING_STEER_COMBINE(1,1) MULTIPLY ! [D] How to combine the two components
MZ_PARKING_STEER_FZ_CONSTANT(1,1) 1 ; - ! [D] Steering torque at kingpin component
                                    ! due to vertical load, axle 1, left side

! Col 1 = vehicle speed (km/h), col 2 = steering torque at kingpin (N-m)
